outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;color: rgb(178, 178, 178);font-size: 14px;\">\n          图片来源 Cafe Import 绿色区域是Chiapas产区\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);clear: both;min-height: 1em;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: left;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SANvK175VaJ7FbBNJWgLoPCTLH62GskxuO0rAsZQUV7tR7BdyJ2EaOvj99todDAUEFvy4RghMyLA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;text-align: center;display: initial;visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QteTlSnpLUg8kVFExaeWEbjfNstl6Hu0zuT9KUcgS6iaGjSJVxGlty7OUt3SRBDD8W7hvKFS5R1Ug/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 8px;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n           关于 Zapotitla\n          </strong>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n           Zapotitla庄园坐落于托图塔拉的韦拉克鲁斯小镇，约瑟·贾维尔是这里的\n           <span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n            庄园主。作为家族第三代咖啡种植者，贾维尔把他的全身心都投入到了咖啡种植\n           </span>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n            中。7年前，为了改善咖啡的处理方式，他们开始经营这门家族产业，现如今已\n           </span>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n            经向外出口了。他和他的家族致力于生产精品咖啡，销售对象是墨西哥的专业人\n           </span>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n            士和知名咖啡店。\n           </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n           为了生产精品咖啡，他们尽可能挑选营养价值高的成熟鲜果，然后进行日晒、\n           <span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n            蜜处理或水洗处理。生产过程中每一批次的咖啡都要做好跟踪记录.\n           </span>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n            这里有完整的咖啡生产链，从咖啡苗到咖啡树，每一个过程都见证了他们花\n           </span>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n            的心思，最终成果就体现在咖啡店里的一杯咖啡当中了。庄园里种植了瑰夏种，\n           </span>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n            这里有天然的本土树木为它们遮阴，为了保护土壤，他们从不使用除草剂。他们\n           </span>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n            还会在实验室中定期评估瑰夏的质量。\n           </span>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n            值得一提的是，这是一门家族产业，家族中的每个人都会负责这个生产链中\n           </span>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n            的某一道工序。\n           </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n            处理方式\n           </strong>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n           采摘高峰期主要集中在二月。收获季的时候严格采摘完全成熟的咖啡鲜果，\n          </section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n           处理过程既经济又环保，接着利用日晒进行干燥，然后在抬高的晒床上和温室里\n           <span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n            避光干燥，最后用麻袋和谷物袋打包储存。\n           </span>\n</section>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n          更多咖啡豆选购，请关注收藏小程序和淘宝店铺哦～\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n          <img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RicESSboT2yAGicv25eicYwA9eYTVnj6tnDXYWHJ5amUjBqzNK6pdB5dhozgCKLqOuf9IgicGe5pVLibQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;font-size: var(--articleFontsize);caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
